  21: `<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-10 mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:#2F5E9E">FREE ROUND-TRIP TICKETS USA - VIETNAM</h2><img src="https://thinksmartinsurance.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/free-round-trip-ticket-usa-vn-thinksmart-insurance-thumbnail-1-768x512.jpg" alt="" class="w-full rounded-xl my-6 object-cover" style="max-height:460px"/><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">To serve the travel needs of Vietnamese people in the U.S. returning to Vietnam to visit family and celebrate the <strong>Lunar New Year</strong>, VietPoint Insurance & Tax is proud to launch the <strong>Free Round-Trip Ticket Giveaway Program 2025</strong>.</p><hr class="my-6 border-gray-200"/><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-10 mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:#2F5E9E">About the Program</h2><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">This program is our heartfelt thank-you gift to the Vietnamese-American community that has trusted VietPoint Insurance & Tax with their family's financial protection.</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Prize:</strong> 1 Round-Trip Economy Ticket — USA ↔ Vietnam (any major Vietnamese airport)</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Program period:</strong> August 1, 2024 – December 31, 2024</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Drawing:</strong> January 5, 2025</p><hr class="my-6 border-gray-200"/><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-10 mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:#2F5E9E">Eligibility Requirements</h2><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">To participate, you must meet ONE of the following:</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">✅ <strong>Option A — Existing Client</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">You are an active VietPoint Insurance & Tax policyholder as of August 1, 2024.</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">✅ <strong>Option B — New Client</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">You purchase a new VietPoint Insurance & Tax policy between August 1 and December 31, 2024.</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">✅ <strong>Option C — Referral</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">You successfully refer a friend or family member who schedules a consultation with our agents.</p><hr class="my-6 border-gray-200"/><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-10 mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:#2F5E9E">How to Submit Your Entry</h2><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-3 space-y-1"><li class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Call us at <strong>(678) 825-3737</strong> or visit our office</li><li class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Confirm your eligibility with your agent</li><li class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Complete the entry form</li><li class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Receive your entry confirmation</li></ol><hr class="my-6 border-gray-200"/><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-10 mb-4 leading-tight" style="color:#2F5E9E">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Q: Can I enter multiple times?</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">A: Yes — you earn 1 additional entry for each successful referral.</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Q: Is the ticket transferable?</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">A: No — the ticket is in the winner's name only.</p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2"><strong>Q: When is the flight?</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">A: Flexible — winner can choose any date during Lunar New Year season (Jan–Feb 2025).</p><hr class="my-6 border-gray-200"/><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">📞 <strong>(678) 825-3737</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">📧 <strong>support@VietPointinsurance.com</strong></p><p class="text-gray-700 text-[15px] leading-relaxed my-2">📍 1424 N Brown Rd #450, Lawrenceville, GA 30043</p>`,
